// Cantrip self-ward against weapon strikes. D&D's "reduced bludgeoning/
// piercing/slashing damage" is modeled with the same flat, kind-agnostic
// `ProtectingWard` damage reduction every other abjuration ward in this
// compendium already uses (see dispel_evil_and_good.ron's own
// OtherworldlyWard comment) -- there is no per-damage-kind resistance
// primitive to narrow it to physical-only.
SelfBuff(
    buildup_duration: 0.4,
    cast_duration: 0.2,
    recover_duration: 0.3,
    buffs: [
        BuffDesc(kind: ProtectingWard, data: BuffData(strength: 0.15, duration: Some(6.0))),
    ],
    energy_cost: 10.0,
    meta: (school: Some(Abjuration), source: Some(Arcane)),
)
